 Rationale (devices running Android 11 or lower):
 PrivateLog writes diagnostics to the app's internal files directory as
 logs.txt. The default SharedPreferences hold user-specific settings such as
 saved station coordinates, the Gadgetbridge package name and a custom weather
 server URL. Neither belongs in a cloud backup or a device-to-device transfer;
 both are cheap to recreate after a restore. "sharedpref" path "." covers the
 whole directory, including any preference file added in the future.
-->

<full-backup-content>
    <exclude domain="file" path="logs.txt" />
    <exclude domain="sharedpref" path="." />
</full-backup-content>
